                "title": "3-1/2 x 3-1/2 x Square Corners Ball Bearing Steel Hinges, Pair, Deltana S35BBUx-R",
                "description": "Deltana S35BBUx-R: 3-1/2 x 3-1/2 Square Corner Ball Bearing Hinges, 0.085  thick durable Steel. Package includes a pair of hinges with wood mounting screws. Ball bearing offer smother door action and longer life. Available in 5 different finish colors.",
